  "limitations": [
    "RAF is sampled at rendered frames. Before correction, six exact first ticks were observed for each stationary face. After correction, four exact first ticks per face were observed; other individual first ticks were skipped by RAF. All six actual emission hook calls per face are logged and follow original six-frame cadence, with original recovery phase. No claim is made that every simulation tick was individually drawn.",
    "Backward input does not move Amanda during the authored attack: start zeros vx and prepare returns during attack. No continuous x-motion drift is claimed for these stationary cases.",
    "Interrupted bursts retain the historical stored origin and queued rounds. A numerical separation up to21.83worldpx from the hypothetically translated rifle point was measured during the uncorrected reaction to a real hit. The patch intentionally does not hold a rifle or refresh origins after hit/KO/attack replacement.",
    "KO behavior was inspected in code and fixture, not forced in the browser: ordinary roundEnd clears all projectiles after projectileStep. No claim that bullets keep firing across subsequent KO rounds.",
    "No real airborne Venus case was run. Amanda Super startup35 exceeds remaining normal jump flight after jump is legitimately begun (engine jump -12.6, gravity0.72); no airborne state or altered startup was injected. Venus Core PSG1 remains HOLD and inactive.",
